This package is a port of Dream Labs' `dreamlabs-client` 1.0.8 and parts of `dreamlabs` 1.0.17 (both
Apache-2.0), and bundles data derived from `dreamlabs` (dream_ik's arm specifications and URDF kinematic chains,
in src/ik/arms.data.ts, and dream_ik's metal.urdf in test/fixtures/). Whatever license is chosen must carry
Apache-2.0's attribution and NOTICE obligations for that material (see those packages' LICENSE, NOTICE and
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md files).
